much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LERioYAzSn742f7QUFAj48nNu7213C8I", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@suechimu/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/69944384/uploads/origins/f931f0c4-01a3-4b3f-b0d0-1a6ce2361996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ad76b13977af64981adee803cf564e7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/69944384/uploads/origins/f931f0c4-01a3-4b3f-b0d0-1a6ce2361996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ad76b13977af64981adee803cf564e7, https://si.imgix.net/69944384/uploads/origins/f931f0c4-01a3-4b3f-b0d0-1a6ce2361996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ea5e748ee1131c9d9364dacf2791a49 2x, https://si.imgix.net/69944384/uploads/origins/f931f0c4-01a3-4b3f-b0d0-1a6ce2361996?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed24898741b527fed652ee6188946b46 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "seneiさん、お忙しいところすみません！\n下のリンクにある女の子を描いてください。彼女の詳細は「キャラクターセット」で見ることができます。彼女はちょっとやんちゃでとてもかわいい女の子です。\n構図やポーズは自由に決めてください！\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rn5WngNH_TvGwu0b4MsrAV1zCzPcka3a?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@suechimu/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/456ff1c6/uploads/origins/4204ebc2-8dd7-42c9-b5aa-35b15a002094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9039c0c66dcfc694ec7326744f272f6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/456ff1c6/uploads/origins/4204ebc2-8dd7-42c9-b5aa-35b15a002094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9039c0c66dcfc694ec7326744f272f6, https://si.imgix.net/456ff1c6/uploads/origins/4204ebc2-8dd7-42c9-b5aa-35b15a002094?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfbb94fdb3bc5e6feb9e3152089534bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/456ff1c6/uploads/origins/4204ebc2-8dd7-42c9-b5aa-35b15a002094?bg=%23ff